### Arquivo para testar a API direto do VS Code (extensão REST Client) ou do Visual Studio/Rider.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1) Login (copie o accessToken da resposta para a variável abaixo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@devjourney.local", "password": "Admin@123" }

###
@token = COLE_O_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI

### 2) Listar usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?search=&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Criar usuário (somente Admin) -> publica "user.created" no RabbitMQ
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Maria Silva", "email": "maria@teste.com", "password": "Senha@123", "role": "User" }

### 4) Logs de auditoria (vindos do MongoDB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) Health check de prontidão (Postgres, MongoDB, RabbitMQ)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
